{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0124-s003", "text": "De flesta använder nätbankskoder för att uträtta ärenden elektroniskt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-e-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T044247015684+0000-3/hb-c12-u0124-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.27178955078125, "generation_seconds": 23.928722186014056, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0125-s001", "text": "Man ansöker om nätbankskoder hos sin egen bank.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-e-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T044247015684+0000-3/hb-c12-u0125-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.458231292517007, "peak": 0.40185546875, "generation_seconds": 16.2571491219569, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0125-s002", "text": "I allmänhet är det värt att fråga efter koderna när man öppnar ett bankkonto.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-e-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T044247015684+0000-3/hb-c12-u0125-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.363861083984375, "generation_seconds": 20.460765371099114, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0125-s003", "text": "Det ställs ändå högre krav på nätbankskoder än på att öppna ett konto.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-e-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T044247015684+0000-3/hb-c12-u0125-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.269012451171875, "generation_seconds": 21.770802401937544, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0125-s004", "text": "Ibland kan banken inte bevilja nätbankskoder, även om man får öppna ett konto.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-e-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T044247015684+0000-3/hb-c12-u0125-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.336761474609375, "generation_seconds": 24.78330328199081, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0125-s005", "text": "Banken kan till exempel kräva att man har ett identitetskort som utfärdats av polisen i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-e-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T044247015684+0000-3/hb-c12-u0125-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.361572265625, "generation_seconds": 31.371679770061746, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0126-s001", "text": "Nätbankskoder och andra verktyg för stark autentisering är alltid personliga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-e-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T044247015684+0000-3/hb-c12-u0126-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.37811279296875, "generation_seconds": 24.44007628899999, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0126-s002", "text": "De får aldrig lämnas ut till någon annan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-e-tjanster/narration/resume-20261103T044247015684+0000-3/hb-c12-u0126-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.40777587890625, "generation_seconds": 13.880916471825913, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
